cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the accompanying manuscript
  (preferred-citation below), which is archived on Zenodo.
title: >-
  Signed Context Decomposition: reference implementation for
  "Amplitude-Tilt Complementarity and the Gauge Trace Anomaly as a
  Signed Context Decomposition"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the signed context decomposition introduced in the
  accompanying technical note. Computes the exact invariants of a signed L1
  context - the signed net, the gross magnitude, and the cancellation index
  kappa = 1 - |net|/gross - reproduces the signed gauge-sector decomposition of
  the Standard Model high-temperature trace-anomaly coefficient, and exhibits
  the algebraic blindness of a net-only observable to the gross magnitude and to
  the cancellation.
